與推論應用上持續加碼。以前的 AI 像是花錢「培養員工」，現在的 AI 則是讓訓練好的員工「24 小時不間斷幫企業賺錢」。從全球雲端服務商瘋狂擴建資料中心來看，這場生產力革命才正要進入使用量爆發期！","sentiment":-1,"tags":{"topics":["擴產/資本支出","法人動向","AI/半導體"],"bull":[],"bear":["賣超","利空"],"score":-5,"highlights":[],"keywords":["江國中","點股成金","摩爾投顧","趨勢分析","台積電","聯發科","鴻海"]},"time":"10/28 08:19"},{"id":"6c8b30f68218fdfe","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《投信買超8-7》旺宏(169)、義隆(168)、高力(164)","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOZXlqeWtjc2g4QXZxMURWbjdoRGwyWEZQUEdIRXlYWGgtUVJubmxoSkJsRnJXRkdVR2JkaTFjZWNzZTEyWFYyaFNEZ0J4M1htZjRxaUV0QVpoX3RFZ3oySXljVFBwTHNsRk1FVXI0cEhuMXAyRzFkdWRIMy11R3FTd1Y1T2RnQmM5?oc=5","published":1793087940,"summary":"《投信買超8-7》旺宏(169)、義隆(168)、高力(164) 富聯網","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["買超"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/27 15:59"},{"id":"a98fc51710a4ae1e","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《投信買超8-7》旺宏(169)、義隆(168)、高力(164)","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOOHpycVlXYXhvejJxeTAydFJ6Y2RFTGZWLUZmQ2dLVktweE15SlBLeFFSN3dwc2szQ2w1QW1FZ3AyenU3c3BUVmQ2azd3X0s3QTJldk84NjRqMGNFdTlTbS1FSFBQN1Y3azZHYmJsbEV2NndKbldhaFlabTBIMVFfcTFYdlROSnlJ?oc=5","published":1793087940,"summary":"《投信買超8-7》旺宏(169)、義隆(168)、高力(164) 富聯網","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["買超"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/27 15:59"},{"id":"8c96c78f81514c22","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《投信買超7-4》廣達(363)、聯發科(357)、高力(341)","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOaVUtQjFNR0w4LUJqdEljdm9vVkRIeTdaSFRNYzUyUThTV0N6Y3UwREUzWkR2RHRjWGJ6VDRzYjcycHVOUnJCbzZXQXlwQlNrVlJUUko3eUpTQml5ZVdPNGd0M0ozYnR0eW8xNVlhdVJTZExPZ3lqZFNZNzJ6ODBzUGtYejh3UGp2?oc=5","published":1793068620,"summary":"《投信買超7-4》廣達(363)、聯發科(357)、高力(341) 富聯網","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["買超"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/27 10:37"},{"id":"c089573d4fba3c34","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《投信買超7-4》廣達(363)、聯發科(3